      "name": "Burning Hoofprints",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "fire",
        "unholy"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The vordine Strides, trailing hoofprints in each square they exit. The hoofprints burn for 1 minute. A creature on the ground that enters a square with burning hoofprints or begins its turn in one takes 1d4 Fire Damage damage.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Trident of Dis",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The vordine makes a trident Strike, increasing their reach to 10 feet for that Strike. If there is an unholy ally between the vordine and their target, that creature's energy causes the Strike to deal an additional 1d6 spirit damage.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
